  "description": "<p>Constructed with comfort, durability, and visibility in mind; Rothco&rsquo;s Moisture Wicking Long Sleeve Pocket T-Shirt is an optimal workwear shirt. The high visibility safety green color makes this safety shirt ideal for hunting, construction, landscaping and numerous other outdoor activities and professions. The long sleeve design means this high visibility shirt is perfect to wear on its own, or to layer underneath additional safety clothing. The moisture wicking, high-performance design of this hi-vis long sleeve keeps you comfortably cool while working. This long sleeve work t-shirt is made with spun polyester for a soft and breathable feel.&nbsp;This workwear t-shirt is accented with a left chest pocket.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
